abstract: "A cone-preservation test that orders cooling Gibbs preparations at all times for a family of divergences; for complete-graph bosonic rates with common coupling it holds for all spectra and bath temperatures exactly when the jump weight is concave; certified super-Ohmic relative-entropy crossing; certified total-variation reversal inside the cone-preserving class; an unbounded induced-subsystem hierarchy. Unrefereed candidate; internal AI-assisted review only. Text and data CC0-1.0; code MIT."
